<title>USA: GOLF-LEADING MONEY WINNERS ON U.S. PGA TOUR.</title>
<headline>GOLF-LEADING MONEY WINNERS ON U.S. PGA TOUR.</headline>
<dateline>PONTE VEDRA BEACH, Florida 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading money</p>
<p>winners on the PGA Tour, following the Las Vegas event won by</p>
<p>Tiger Woods, who jumped to 40th from 131st after a top prize</p>
<p>of $297,000 gave him winnings of $437,194 from five events</p>
<p>(U.S. unless noted):</p>
<p>  1. Phil Mickelson			 $1,620,999</p>
<p>  2. Mark MBrooks			    1,374,244</p>
<p>  3. Tom Lehman				1,240,159</p>
<p>  4. Mark O'Meara			    1,196,949</p>
<p>  5. Steve Stricker			  1,176,739</p>
<p>  6. Davis Love III			  1,137,939</p>
<p>  7. Fred Couples			    1,128,694</p>
<p>  8. Scott Hoch				  958,924</p>
<p>  9. David Duval				 913,479</p>
<p> 10. Greg Norman (Australia)		 891,237</p>
<p> 11. Nick Faldo (Britain)		    889,821</p>
<p> 12. Tommy Tolles				819,989</p>
<p> 13. Justin Leonard			    817,312</p>
<p> 14. Ernie Els (South Africa)		804,944</p>
<p> 15. Kenny Perry				 781,079</p>
<p> 16. Corey Pavin				 769,244</p>
<p> 17. Vijay Singh (Fiji)			767,540</p>
<p> 18. Michael Bradley			   766,825</p>
<p> 19. Steve Jones				 751,844</p>
<p> 20. Fred Funk				   744,734</p>
